---
/**
 * The first focusable thing on every page.
 *
 * Its target is the `<main id="content">` the shell itself renders, so the link
 * cannot go stale when a page family changes — there is exactly one main and the
 * shell owns it.
 *
 * Markup keeps normal capitalisation. The lowercase is a text-transform in
 * styles/reset.css, so a screen reader is never handed "s k i p".
 */
---

<a class="skip-link" href="#content">Skip to content</a>
